course: dictionary
lesson: 2659
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Development means growing or changing, becoming bigger, stronger or more advanced. A baby's development is how it grows and learns over time.
explain: «The African Union links all 55 African countries to work together on peace, trade and development.» The clues are peace, trade and work together. Development here means countries growing and improving together. Try your meaning in the sentence: "work together on peace, trade and growing better" still makes sense.
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. «Game development includes programmers, artists, animators, sound designers, writers, testers, producers, community managers and more.» Here development means making a new product, a game. The words around it show which meaning is right.
fact: Development means growing or changing and becoming more advanced.
fact: A development can also be a new event or piece of news that changes a situation, as in «the latest development».
fact: Development can mean building new houses, roads or businesses on land.
fact: «Child development» means how a child grows and learns, and «software development» means making new computer programs.
fact: «Developing countries» are poorer countries that are still building roads, schools and hospitals.
exercise: «Game development includes programmers, artists, animators and testers.» What does development mean here? | *Making a new game | Growing taller and bigger | A sad piece of news | Building a house
exercise: Which phrase means that something new has just happened? | software development | child development | developing countries | *the latest development
exercise: What does «child development» mean? | A sudden loud noise | The name of a school | *How a child grows and learns | A kind of toy
test: In «The African Union links all 55 African countries to work together on peace, trade and development», what does development most likely mean? | Ending a meeting | A type of game | Losing money | *Growing and improving together
test: A town shows development when new roads, schools and hospitals are built. What does that show? | The town has run out of roads | The town is getting smaller | *The town is growing and improving | The town has no people
exam: In «Game development includes programmers, artists, animators, sound designers, writers, testers, producers, community managers and more.», what do the words around development tell you? | It means a sad event | It means how a frog grows | *It means making a new product, a game | It means developing a photo from film
